{"id":2954,"date":"2017-01-10T21:22:04","date_gmt":"2017-01-11T04:22:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=2954"},"modified":"2017-01-10T21:22:04","modified_gmt":"2017-01-11T04:22:04","slug":"and-now-for-the-rest-of-the-story","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/01\/10\/and-now-for-the-rest-of-the-story\/","title":{"rendered":"And now for the REST of the story &#8230;"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>As a follow-up (part 2) to\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/01\/10\/honey-shouldnt-we-get-those-toad-brakes-installed\/\" target=\"_blank\">Honey, shouldn&#8217;t we get those toad brakes installed?<\/a>\u00a0I wanted to let you know that all is well.<\/p>\n<p>The folks at <a href=\"http:\/\/www.littledealer.com\/pages\/prescott%20valley%20location\" target=\"_blank\">Little Dealer Little Prices<\/a> in Prescott Valley, AZ did a great job. \u00a0We had stopped in a month or so ago and talked with one of their technicians (Lance) and he told us it would probably take 4-6 hours to get the system installed in the coach and the car (toad).<\/p>\n<p>I called the service desk last Friday, talked with Colt Sullivan at the counter and we made the appointment for today (the next Tuesday). \u00a0We got there about 9:30 and Lance was ready and got right on it. \u00a0He finished up about 4:00 p.m., we hooked up the car to the tow bar and Kathy and I took a spin or two around the lot and all worked beautifully &#8211; just as Roadmaster had promised.<\/p>\n<p>I have to say it was a real pleasure working with the folks at <a href=\"http:\/\/www.littledealer.com\/pages\/prescott%20valley%20location\" target=\"_blank\">Little Dealer Little Prices<\/a>. \u00a0They actually did what they said they were going to do, they did it on time, they didn&#8217;t charge me more for things they &#8220;found&#8221; <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">and<\/span> we were treated by any of the staff we encountered with courtesy and respect. \u00a0They have a comfortable and clean customer lounge (the old western schoolhouse) and their WiFi is open and works great.<\/p>\n<p>I shot the video of their showroom and placed it in <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/01\/10\/honey-shouldnt-we-get-those-toad-brakes-installed\/\">part 1 of this post<\/a>, but since then I shot a few of the hallway and offices, wanted to share these with you. \u00a0The slide show is below. \u00a0If you&#8217;re viewing this post from an email sent to you, you MAY not see the slide show. \u00a0Just click on the post title up at the top of this email (by my head shot) and you&#8217;ll be taken directly to the blog where you will be able to see the slide show.<\/p>\n<div id='gallery-1' class='gallery galleryid-2954 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail'><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-10-11-07-47.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-10-11-07-47-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-10-11-07-55.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-10-11-07-55-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-10-14-49-12.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-10-14-49-12-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-10-14-49-17.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-10-14-49-17-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-10-15-27-47.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-10-15-27-47-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-10-15-27-58.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-10-15-27-58-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure><figure class='gallery-item'>\n\t\t\t<div class='gallery-icon landscape'>\n\t\t\t\t<a href='https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-10-15-28-08.jpg'><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/01\/2017-01-10-15-28-08-150x150.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"\" \/><\/a>\n\t\t\t<\/div><\/figure>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\n<p>So we&#8217;re back home for a few more days until we head out to <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/01\/01\/our-adventure-to-quartzsite\/\" target=\"_blank\">Quartzsite<\/a>. \u00a0I&#8217;ll write more about that as we head that way and once we&#8217;re there in the desert.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>As a follow-up (part 2) to\u00a0Honey, shouldn&#8217;t we get those toad brakes installed?\u00a0I wanted to let you know that all is well. The folks at Little Dealer Little Prices in Prescott Valley, AZ did a great job. \u00a0We had stopped in a month or so ago and talked with one of their technicians (Lance) and &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2017\/01\/10\/and-now-for-the-rest-of-the-story\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">And now for the REST of the story &#8230;<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[13403,18285,264],"tags":[307454,14210392,554707232,554707226,5814266,1098501,5682756],"class_list":["post-2954","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-camping","category-equipment","category-learning","tag-brakes","tag-braking-system","tag-camping","tag-little-dealer","tag-prescott-valley","tag-roadmaster","tag-rv-service"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2954","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2954"}],"version-history":[{"count":23,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2954\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2984,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/2954\/revisions\/2984"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com